Ah, it's you!{VAR BE01}
We were raising your Pokémon,
and my goodness, were we surprised!{VAR BE01}
Your Pokémon was holding an Egg!{VAR BE01}
We don't know how it got there,
but your Pokémon had it.{VAR BE01}
You do want it, don't you?

I'm the Day-Care Lady.{VAR BE01}
We can raise Pokémon for you.
What do you want to do today?

You can't leave your only Pokémon
with me! How would you battle?{VAR BE01}
Come back another time.

If you want your {VAR 0101 0000} back,
it will cost ${VAR 0204 0001}.{VAR BE00}
Do you want it back?

Huh? Now, now.{VAR BE01}
If you leave that Pokémon with
me, you'll be left with just one.{VAR BE01}
You will be better off if you catch
some more, if I do say so myself.
